06:50.191 --> 06:54.116
We can go one above, one
below, one above, one below.

06:54.116 --> 06:55.578
And that's in general truths.

06:55.578 --> 06:57.061
We take derivatives as integrals.

06:57.061 --> 06:58.894
But the endpoints of our interval

06:58.894 --> 07:00.758
of convergence can be different.

07:00.758 --> 07:02.693
And to continue to see this,

